# CD matrix with a missing DIAGONAL element: CD1_1, CD1_2, CD2_1 set,
# CD2_2 absent. wcslib (wcs.h, altlin: "If one or more CDi_ja keywords are
# present then all unspecified CDi_ja default to zero") takes CD2_2 = 0;
# an identity default (as for PCi_j) would give CD2_2 = 1.
# Synthetic.
NOTE pipeline: CD matrix with a missing diagonal element defaults to 0
GRID 1 512 9 1 512 9
PIX 256.5 256.5
HEADER
NAXIS   = 2
NAXIS1  = 512
NAXIS2  = 512
CTYPE1  = 'RA---TAN'
CTYPE2  = 'DEC--TAN'
CRVAL1  = 180.0
CRVAL2  = 30.0
CRPIX1  = 256.5
CRPIX2  = 256.5
CD1_1   = -0.001
CD1_2   = 0.0003
CD2_1   = 0.001
